            <ArticleTitle>Idiopathic arterial calcification in infancy. A case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>55-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An infant with idiopathic arterial calcification is presented. The disease was diagnosed during the life of the patient as an aortogram demonstrated a stenosis of the left coronary artery and complete occlusion of the right coronary artery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
